            <ArticleTitle>Hypercholesterolemia in children: risk and management.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>152-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Hypercholesterolemia in children is currently a controversial issue. Screening and management recommendations are inconsistent due to the lack of longitudinal data currently available to support specific long-term interventions. Children who are generally at risk and the options for management are discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
